  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players bet against the house.\n2. Players can 'Hit' (draw more cards) one by one.\n3. If a player reaches 21, they win immediately.\n4. If they exceed 21, they are out.\n5. The Banker draws last and must beat all 'Open' hands to win their bets.",
    Player: "1. Players bet against the house.\n2. Players can 'Hit' (draw more cards) one by one.\n3. If a player reaches 21, they win immediately.\n4. If they exceed 21, they are out.\n5. The Banker draws last and must beat all 'Open' hands to win their bets.",
